          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha minyago egyo enusu ey'Abaisiraeli, ahali buli ndore 50, Musa yaihyaho endore emoi, n'ahali buli bitunganwa 50, yaihyaho ekitunganwa kimoi: Eminyago egyo eyo yaronzire yagiha Abalevita ababaire nibalinda Eihema ly'Omukama, nk'okwo Omukama wenene yamuhangiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
